2">no</span><span begin="03:16.922" end="03:17.538">tsuyo</span><span begin="03:17.538" end="03:17.772">sa</span><span begin="03:17.772" end="03:17.977">wo</span><span begin="03:17.977" end="03:18.444">shi</span><span begin="03:18.444" end="03:18.591">ru</span><span begin="03:18.591" end="03:18.876">me</span><span begin="03:18.876" end="03:19.647">de</span></text><text for="L45"><span begin="03:19.695" end="03:20.360">hizun</span><span begin="03:20.360" end="03:20.539">da</span><span begin="03:20.539" end="03:20.788">ra</span><span begin="03:20.788" end="03:21.490">sen</span><span begin="03:21.490" end="03:22.092">ni</span><span begin="03:22.309" end="03:22.549">ki</span><span begin="03:22.549" end="03:23.026">zu</span><span begin="03:23.026" end="03:23.235">i</span><span begin="03:23.235" end="03:23.732">te</span></text><text for="L46"><span begin="03:23.796" end="03:24.241">aru</span><span begin="03:24.241" end="03:24.927">ki</span><span begin="03:24.927" end="03:25.334">dashi</span><span begin="03:25.334" end="03:25.700">ta</span><span begin="03:25.801" end="03:26.698">boku</span><span begin="03:26.698" end="03:27.098">no</span><span begin="03:27.098" end="03:27.572">mi</span><span begin="03:27.572" end="03:30.616">rai</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:53.256"><div begin="00:07.539" end="03:30.616"><p begin="00:07.539" end="00:13.771" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:07.539" end="00:07.675">記</span><span begin="00:07.675" end="00:08.142">憶</span><span begin="00:08.142" end="00:08.350">を</span><span begin="00:08.350" end="00:08.770">辿</span><span begin="00:08.770" end="00:09.246">って</span> <span begin="00:09.246" end="00:10.231">不意に</span><span begin="00:10.231" end="00:10.652">見え</span><span begin="00:10.652" end="00:11.049">た</span> <span begin="00:11.049" end="00:11.649">その</span><span begin="00:11.649" end="00:11.875">視</span><span begin="00:11.875" end="00:12.879">線</span><span begin="00:12.879" end="00:13.771">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">循着记忆望去</span></p><p begin="00:14.587" end="00:20.545" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:14.587" end="00:15.013">望</span><span begin="00:15.013" end="00:15.230">ま</span><span begin="00:15.230" end="00:15.675">ない</span><span begin="00:15.675" end="00:16.131">僕</span><span begin="00:16.131" end="00:16.411">の</span><span begin="00:16.411" end="00:17.296">世界</span><span begin="00:17.296" end="00:17.984">を</span> <span begin="00:17.984" end="00:18.854">壊し</span><span begin="00:18.854" end="00:19.560">始</span><span begin="00:19.560" end="00:19.966">め</span><span begin="00:19.966" end="00:20.545">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令我本不愿面对的世界开始分崩瓦解</span></p><p begin="00:20.810" end="00:24.315" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:20.810" end="00:21.298">背を</span><span begin="00:21.298" end="00:21.743">預</span><span begin="00:21.743" end="00:22.306">け</span> <span begin="00:22.634" end="00:23.076">前</span><span begin="00:23.076" end="00:23.236">を</span><span begin="00:23.236" end="00:23.527">向</span><span begin="00:23.527" end="00:24.315">け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">交付后背 迈步向前</span></p><p begin="00:24.433" end="00:27.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:24.433" end="00:25.277">運命</span><span begin="00:25.277" end="00:25.879">を</span><span begin="00:25.879" end="00:26.402">変え</span><span begin="00:26.402" end="00:26.637">た</span><span begin="00:26.637" end="00:27.085">い</span><span begin="00:27.085" end="00:27.857">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能将命运改写</span></p><p begin="00:27.972" end="00:32.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:27.972" end="00:28.415">全</span><span begin="00:28.415" end="00:28.620">て</span><span begin="00:28.620" end="00:28.860">の</span><span begin="00:28.860" end="00:30.407">声を</span> <span begin="00:30.407" end="00:31.124">掲</span><span begin="00:31.271" end="00:31.746">げ</span><span begin="00:31.746" end="00:32.324">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听到了将所有心声高举的声响</span></p><p begin="00:32.438" end="00:34.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:32.438" end="00:33.305">音</span><span begin="00:33.390" end="00:33.806">が</span><span begin="00:33.806" end="00:34.025">し</span><span begin="00:34.025" end="00:34.638">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">才终于听见那声音</span></p><p begin="00:53.444" end="00:56.082" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:53.444" end="00:53.557">無</span><span begin="00:53.557" end="00:54.136">数</span><span begin="00:54.136" end="00:54.302">に</span><span begin="00:54.302" end="00:54.785">散っ</span><span begin="00:54.785" end="00:55.219">た</span><span begin="00:55.219" end="00:56.082">影</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾凝望无数飘散的残影 露出笑容的我</span></p><p begin="00:56.082" end="00:59.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:56.082" end="00:56.546">視</span><span begin="00:56.546" end="00:56.940">て</span> <span begin="00:56.940" end="00:57.810">笑った</span><span begin="00:57.810" end="00:58.671">僕</span><span begin="00:58.671" end="00:59.733">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却露出了笑容</span></p><p begin="01:00.469" end="01:02.243" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:00.469" end="01:00.824">色</span><span begin="01:00.824" end="01:01.056">を</span><span begin="01:01.056" end="01:01.949">失っ</span><span begin="01:01.949" end="01:02.243">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要为失去色彩的这个世界再度点亮璀璨光芒</span></p><p begin="01:02.243" end="01:06.392" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:02.243" end="01:03.558">世界に</span><span begin="01:03.558" end="01:03.934">また</span><span begin="01:03.934" end="01:04.600">灯り(光)</span><span begin="01:04.600" end="01:04.817">を</span><span begin="01:04.817" end="01:06.392">灯す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再度点亮明灯</span></p><p begin="01:06.592" end="01:09.960" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:06.592" end="01:07.149">壊</span><span begin="01:07.149" end="01:07.461">れ</span><span begin="01:07.461" end="01:08.056">て</span> <span begin="01:08.277" end="01:08.893">嘆</span><span begin="01:08.893" end="01:09.199">い</span><span begin="01:09.199" end="01:09.960">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在毁灭与叹息中迎来梦境的终焉</span></p><p begin="01:10.109" end="01:13.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:10.109" end="01:10.909">夢</span><span begin="01:10.909" end="01:11.629">の</span><span begin="01:11.629" end="01:12.034">終</span><span begin="01:12.034" end="01:12.343">わ</span><span begin="01:12.343" end="01:12.698">り</span><span begin="01:12.698" end="01:13.427">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在梦的尽头</span></p><p begin="01:13.560" end="01:17.027" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:13.560" end="01:14.120">繋</span><span begin="01:14.120" end="01:14.448">い</span><span begin="01:14.448" end="01:15.125">だ</span><span begin="01:15.309" end="01:16.171">心</span><span begin="01:16.171" end="01:17.027">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凭彼此牵系的心</span></p><p begin="01:17.141" end="01:22.227" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:17.141" end="01:17.882">何度</span><span begin="01:17.882" end="01:18.080">も</span><span begin="01:18.080" end="01:18.574">振り</span><span begin="01:18.574" end="01:19.011">解</span><span begin="01:19.011" end="01:19.280">い</span><span begin="01:19.280" end="01:19.624">て</span> <span begin="01:19.624" end="01:20.149">今日</span><span begin="01:20.149" end="01:20.520">を</span><span begin="01:20.520" end="01:21.115">護</span><span begin="01:21.115" end="01:21.432">る</span><span begin="01:21.432" end="01:21.685">か</span><span begin="01:21.685" end="01:22.227">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次次地挣脱束缚 只为牢牢守护今天</span></p><p begin="01:23.045" end="01:27.162" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:23.045" end="01:23.557">歩</span><span begin="01:23.557" end="01:23.746">き</span><span begin="01:23.746" end="01:24.221">続</span><span begin="01:24.221" end="01:24.453">け</span><span begin="01:24.453" end="01:24.875">た</span> <span begin="01:24.875" end="01:25.109">こ</span><span begin="01:25.109" end="01:25.463">の</span><span begin="01:25.463" end="01:26.371">軌跡/奇跡</span><span begin="01:26.371" end="01:27.162">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将步履不停留下的轨迹/奇迹都粉碎吧</span></p><p begin="01:27.258" end="01:28.725" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:27.258" end="01:28.101">壊</span><span begin="01:28.101" end="01:28.725">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毁灭殆尽</span></p><p begin="01:30.826" end="01:34.125" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:30.826" end="01:30.973">未</span><span begin="01:30.973" end="01:31.415">来</span><span begin="01:31.415" end="01:31.556">を</span><span begin="01:31.556" end="01:31.831">裂</span><span begin="01:31.831" end="01:32.308">け</span> <span begin="01:32.487" end="01:32.653">名</span><span begin="01:32.653" end="01:33.090">前</span><span begin="01:33.090" end="01:33.277">を</span><span begin="01:33.277" end="01:33.567">呼</span><span begin="01:33.567" end="01:34.125">べ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撕裂未来 呼唤真名</span></p><p begin="01:34.226" end="01:37.829" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="01:34.226" end="01:34.618">決め</span><span begin="01:34.618" end="01:34.997">られ</span><span begin="01:34.997" end="01:35.333">た</span><span begin="01:35.333" end="01:35.924">過去</span><span begin="01:35.924" end="01:36.087">に</span><span begin="01:36.087" end="01:36.591">背</span><span begin="01:36.591" end="01:37.028">向け</span><span begin="01:37.028" end="01:37.829">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毅然背弃早已既定好的过往</span></p><p begin="01:37.966" end="01:41.386" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="01:37.966" end="01:38.537">運</span><span begin="01:38.537" end="01:39.163">命</span><span begin="01:39.163" end="01:39.376">を</span><span begin="01:39.376" end="01:40.254">弄</span><span begin="01:40.254" end="01:40.483">ぶ</span><span begin="01:40.483" end="01:40.950">今日</span><span begin="01:40.950" end="01:41.386">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻便夺回那操弄命运的今天</span></p><p begin="01:41.477" end="01:44.562" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:41.477" end="01:42.430">今</span><span begin="01:42.430" end="01:42.845">取</span><span begin="01:42.845" end="01:43.485">り</span><span begin="01:43.485" end="01:43.920">戻</span><span begin="01:43.920" end="01:44.562">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于此刻夺回</span></p><p begin="01:44.562" end="01:48.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:44.562" end="01:44.738">世</span><span begin="01:44.738" end="01:45.032">界</span><span begin="01:45.184" end="01:45.341">の</span><span begin="01:45.341" end="01:45.594">果</span><span begin="01:45.594" end="01:46.034">て</span> <span begin="01:46.221" end="01:47.125">視えない</span><span begin="01:47.125" end="01:48.010">夢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在世界尽头 用洞悉话语重量的</span></p><p begin="01:48.095" end="01:51.594" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:48.095" end="01:48.677">言葉</span><span begin="01:48.677" end="01:48.794">の</span><span begin="01:48.794" end="01:49.512">強</span><span begin="01:49.512" end="01:49.776">さ</span><span begin="01:49.776" end="01:49.973">を</span><span begin="01:49.973" end="01:50.579">知る</span><span begin="01:50.579" end="01:50.835">眼</span><span begin="01:50.835" end="01:51.594">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那双眼眸窥见了难以得见的梦</span></p><p begin="01:51.692" end="01:55.660" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:51.692" end="01:52.276">歪ん</span><span begin="01:52.276" end="01:52.514">だ</span><span begin="01:52.514" end="01:52.696">螺</span><span begin="01:52.696" end="01:53.377">旋</span><span begin="01:53.377" end="01:54.090">に</span><span begin="01:54.276" end="01:54.444">気</span><span begin="01:54.444" end="01:54.914">付</span><span begin="01:54.914" end="01:55.159">い</span><span begin="01:55.159" end="01:55.660">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉到早已扭曲的螺旋</span></p><p begin="01:55.778" end="02:00.476" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:55.778" end="01:56.242">歩</span><span begin="01:56.242" end="01:56.914">き</span><span begin="01:56.914" end="01:57.279">出し</span><span begin="01:57.279" end="01:57.572">た</span> <span begin="01:57.744" end="01:58.600">僕</span><span begin="01:58.600" end="01:59.010">の</span><span begin="01:59.010" end="01:59.444">因</span><span begin="01:59.444" end="02:00.476">果</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈步踏上属于我的因果</span></p><p begin="02:06.298" end="02:09.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:06.298" end="02:06.962">希望</span><span begin="02:06.962" end="02:07.271">を</span><span begin="02:07.271" end="02:07.674">刈っ</span><span begin="02:07.674" end="02:08.149">た</span> <span begin="02:08.149" end="02:08.600">手</span><span begin="02:08.600" end="02:08.952">を</span><span begin="02:08.952" end="02:09.400">観</span><span begin="02:09.400" end="02:09.787">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">注视着那双收割希望的手</span></p><p begin="02:09.787" end="02:12.569" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:09.787" end="02:10.181">閉ざ</span><span begin="02:10.181" end="02:10.418">し</span><span begin="02:10.418" end="02:10.723">た</span> <span begin="02:10.723" end="02:11.456">夢</span><span begin="02:11.456" end="02:12.569">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尘封的梦想</span></p><p begin="02:13.203" end="02:16.259" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:13.203" end="02:13.375">時</span><span begin="02:13.375" end="02:13.865">空</span><span begin="02:13.865" end="02:14.079">を</span><span begin="02:14.079" end="02:14.929">縛った</span><span begin="02:14.929" end="02:15.503">世</span><span begin="02:15.503" end="02:15.831">界</span><span begin="02:15.831" end="02:16.259">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝着禁锢时空的世界</span></p><p begin="02:16.328" end="02:19.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:16.328" end="02:16.498">ま</span><span begin="02:16.498" end="02:16.739">た</span><span begin="02:16.739" end="02:17.342">終わり</span><span begin="02:17.342" end="02:17.510">を</span><span begin="02:17.510" end="02:18.435">告げ</span><span begin="02:18.435" end="02:19.043">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次宣告终焉的到来</span></p><p begin="02:19.227" end="02:22.659" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:19.227" end="02:20.081">奪っ</span><span begin="02:20.081" end="02:20.670">て</span><span begin="02:21.025" end="02:21.843">嗤っ</span><span begin="02:21.843" end="02:22.659">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在争夺与嗤笑中迎来梦境的终焉</span></p><p begin="02:22.809" end="02:26.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:22.809" end="02:23.596">夢</span><span begin="02:23.596" end="02:24.273">の</span><span begin="02:24.273" end="02:25.383">終わり</span><span begin="02:25.383" end="02:26.126">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那梦的结局</span></p><p begin="02:26.225" end="02:29.627" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="02:26.225" end="02:27.057">砕い</span><span begin="02:27.057" end="02:27.718">た</span><span begin="02:27.953" end="02:28.780">心</span><span begin="02:28.780" end="02:29.627">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在破碎的心间</span></p><p begin="02:29.859" end="02:34.894" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="02:29.859" end="02:30.275">何</span><span begin="02:30.275" end="02:30.513">度</span><span begin="02:30.513" end="02:30.678">も</span><span begin="02:30.678" end="02:31.110">振り</span><span begin="02:31.110" end="02:31.830">かざし</span><span begin="02:31.830" end="02:32.208">て</span> <span begin="02:32.208" end="02:33.078">夜を</span><span begin="02:33.078" end="02:33.960">告げる</span><span begin="02:33.960" end="02:34.235">か</span><span begin="02:34.235" end="02:34.894">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无数次将其昭示高举</span></p><p begin="02:35.669" end="02:39.835" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="02:35.669" end="02:36.149">刻</span><span begin="02:36.149" end="02:36.320">み</span><span begin="02:36.320" end="02:36.770">続</span><span begin="02:36.770" end="02:37.007">け</span><span begin="02:37.007" end="02:37.416">た</span> <span begin="02:37.416" end="02:37.633">こ</span><span begin="02:37.633" end="02:38.072">の</span><span begin="02:38.072" end="02:38.233">未</span><span begin="02:38.233" end="02:38.963">来</span><span begin="02:38.963" end="02:39.835">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将不懈铭刻的所谓未来亲手夺回</span></p><p begin="02:39.896" end="02:41.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="02:39.896" end="02:40.685">奪</span><span begin="02:40.685" end="02:41.331">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夺去吧</span></p><p begin="02:43.110" end="02:46.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="02:43.110" end="02:43.643">消え</span><span begin="02:43.643" end="02:44.110">ない</span><span begin="02:44.110" end="02:44.763">夢</span> <span begin="02:44.955" end="02:45.497">見せ</span><span begin="02:45.497" end="02:46.113">られた</span><span begin="02:46.113" end="02:46.582">眼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">永不褪色的梦 被迫直视的双眼</span></p><p begin="02:46.731" end="02:50.280" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="02:46.731" end="02:47.094">砕</span><span begin="02:47.094" end="02:47.286">け</span><span begin="02:47.286" end="02:47.729">散る</span> <span begin="02:47.729" end="02:49.092">掌</span><span begin="02:49.092" end="02:49.238">の</span><span begin="02:49.238" end="02:50.280">声</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让掌声变得支离破碎</span></p><p begin="02:50.458" end="02:53.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="02:50.458" end="02:50.970">傷</span><span begin="02:50.970" end="02:51.703">つい</span><span begin="02:51.703" end="02:51.841">た</span> <span begin="02:51.841" end="02:52.308">その</span><span begin="02:52.308" end="02:53.012">瞳</span><span begin="02:53.012" end="02:53.421">か</span><span begin="02:53.421" end="02:53.980">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为那双满载着伤痛的眼眸而赌上这个世界</span></p><p begin="02:53.980" end="02:58.411" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="02:53.980" end="02:54.453">世</span><span begin="02:54.453" end="02:55.260">界</span><span begin="02:55.260" end="02:55.503">を</span><span begin="02:55.503" end="02:56.412">賭け</span><span begin="02:56.412" end="02:58.411">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赌上整个世界</span></p><p begin="02:58.848" end="03:02.147" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:58.848" end="02:58.995">未</span><span begin="02:58.995" end="02:59.437">来</span><span begin="02:59.437" end="02:59.602">を</span><span begin="02:59.602" end="02:59.837">裂</span><span begin="02:59.837" end="03:00.330">け</span> <span begin="03:00.509" end="03:00.675">名</span><span begin="03:00.675" end="03:01.112">前</span><span begin="03:01.112" end="03:01.299">を</span><span begin="03:01.299" end="03:01.589">呼</span><span begin="03:01.589" end="03:02.147">べ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">撕裂未来 呼唤真名</span></p><p begin="03:02.246" end="03:05.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="03:02.246" end="03:02.574">決め</span><span begin="03:02.574" end="03:03.108">られ</span><span begin="03:03.108" end="03:03.371">た</span><span begin="03:03.371" end="03:03.987">過去</span><span begin="03:03.987" end="03:04.147">に</span><span begin="03:04.147" end="03:04.606">背</span><span begin="03:04.606" end="03:05.052">向け</span><span begin="03:05.052" end="03:05.849">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毅然背弃早已既定好的过往</span></p><p begin="03:06.104" end="03:09.524" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="03:06.104" end="03:06.528">運</span><span begin="03:06.528" end="03:07.235">命</span><span begin="03:07.235" end="03:07.400">を</span><span begin="03:07.400" end="03:08.354">弄</span><span begin="03:08.354" end="03:08.570">ぶ</span><span begin="03:08.570" end="03:08.973">今日</span><span begin="03:08.973" end="03:09.524">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻便夺回那操弄命运的今天</span></p><p begin="03:09.529" end="03:12.614" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42"><span begin="03:09.529" end="03:10.482">今</span><span begin="03:10.482" end="03:10.897">取</span><span begin="03:10.897" end="03:11.332">り</span><span begin="03:11.593" end="03:11.956">戻</span><span begin="03:11.956" end="03:12.614">す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">于此刻夺回</span></p><p begin="03:12.540" end="03:15.860" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43"><span begin="03:12.540" end="03:12.860">世</span><span begin="03:12.860" end="03:13.177">界</span><span begin="03:13.274" end="03:13.463">の</span><span begin="03:13.463" end="03:13.687">果</span><span begin="03:13.687" end="03:14.109">て</span> <span begin="03:14.268" end="03:15.223">視えない</span><span begin="03:15.223" end="03:15.860">夢</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在世界尽头 用洞悉话语重量的</span></p><p begin="03:15.994" end="03:19.647" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44"><span begin="03:15.994" end="03:16.501">言</span><span begin="03:16.501" end="03:16.692">葉</span><span begin="03:16.692" end="03:16.922">の</span><span begin="03:16.922" end="03:17.538">強</span><span begin="03:17.538" end="03:17.772">さ</span><span begin="03:17.772" end="03:17.977">を</span><span begin="03:17.977" end="03:18.444">知</span><span begin="03:18.444" end="03:18.591">る</span><span begin="03:18.591" end="03:18.876">眼</span><span begin="03:18.876" end="03:19.647">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那双眼眸窥见了难以得见的梦</span></p><p begin="03:19.695" end="03:23.732" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45"><span begin="03:19.695" end="03:20.360">歪ん</span><span begin="03:20.360" end="03:20.539">だ</span><span begin="03:20.539" end="03:20.788">螺</span><span begin="03:20.788" end="03:21.490">旋</span><span begin="03:21.490" end="03:22.092">に</span><span begin="03:22.309" end="03:22.549">気</span><span begin="03:22.549" end="03:23.026">付</span><span begin="03:23.026" end="03:23.235">い</span><span begin="03:23.235" end="03:23.732">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">察觉到早已扭曲的螺旋</span></p><p begin="03:23.796" end="03:30.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46"><span begin="03:23.796" end="03:24.241">歩</span><span begin="03:24.241" end="03:24.927">き</span><span begin="03:24.927" end="03:25.334">出し</span><span begin="03:25.334" end="03:25.700">た</span> <span begin="03:25.801" end="03:26.698">僕</span><span begin="03:26.698" end="03:27.098">の</span><span begin="03:27.098" end="03:27.572">未</span><span begin="03:27.572" end="03:30.616">来</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">迈步踏上属于我的未来</span></p></div></body></tt>